{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Even now, according to your words.</b> Even this would be true according to strict justice — as your words say, so it is, that all of you are liable in the matter: that the goblet was found in the hand of one of them, all of them should be seized. But I will act for you beyond the line of justice — he with whom it is found, he shall be my slave."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:26.677047118Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}